# D-105 native (steps/d105-native.md §4; the author's Q39: "сначала в интерпретаторе и потом нативно"): a formal admitted
# by name and captured by a callable merge (item 738): `mk (Model: m)` returns `rd`, which reads m\a.  The
# capture copies req's field a from the source at the slot the source's record gives
# (lmx_walk_capture); this row runs under --walk-methods, not at Model's slot 0: 10.  Before: 20 under --walk-methods; without it the root
# refused to hand o to the native mk.  Success is 7.
Model:
    size_t: a 1U
    size_t: b 2U
end: Model
Other:
    size_t: b 20U
    size_t: a 10U
end: Other
fn: mk (Model: m) fn: (size_t: x) size_t
    fn: rd (size_t: x) size_t
        return: m\a + x
    return: rd
Other: o
r: mk o
size_t: got (r: 0U)
int: ok 3
if: got = 10U
    ok: 7
if: got = 20U
    ok: 5
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
